entor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-215d6567\" data-id=\"215d6567\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67836783 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"67836783\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\">What You Can Expect<\/span> <strong>with Harris &amp; Sons Sauna Additions<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4be0a06e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4be0a06e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2182\"><strong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2082\">Free In-Home Consultation<\/strong><br data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2085\" \/>We\u2019ll assess your space, talk through your vision, and provide expert recommendations at no cost.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2337\"><strong data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2213\">Premium-Grade Materials<\/strong><br data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2216\" \/>We use only high-quality cedar, hemlock, and non-porous finishes that stand the test of time and retain heat efficiently.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2491\"><strong data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2368\">Cutting-Edge Technology<\/strong><br data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2371\" \/>Enjoy smart controls, automated timers, RGB lighting options, and built-in audio for the ultimate relaxation experience.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2662\"><strong data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2523\">Steam Room Waterproofing<\/strong><br data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2526\" \/>Steam rooms require expert sealing and slope systems to avoid leaks and moisture damage. We ensure every inch is professionally handled.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2866\"><strong data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2690\">Built for Your Space<\/strong><br data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2693\" \/>Whether it\u2019s a bathroom upgrade, garage conversion, basement corner, or backyard retreat\u2014we create seamless installations that blend perfectly with your home&#8217;s architecture.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-49049bfd elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"49049bfd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3da7ec94\" data-id=\"3da7ec94\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3e2d5696 elementor-section-full_width elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3e2d5696\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&q